' Delta encoding of consecutive causal paths in native evidence (DR-74).
' The v2 recording encodes each path as (shared-prefix length p, suffix
' length s, suffix segments) relative to the previous path. The encoder emits
' the maximal shared prefix; the decoder rejects every non-maximal prefix, so
' each recording has exactly one encoding (NativePathDeltaCodec.v).
'
' Source of truth: docs/casper/theory/cost-accounting-decision-records.md (DR-74);
'                  rholang/src/rust/interpreter/accounting/native_runtime/wire.rs
'                  (write_path_delta, read_path_delta).
' Palette:  paths = supply blue · prefix computation = process lilac
'           canonical entry = pool green · decoder check = gate teal
'           rejected entry = red
' Render:  plantuml -tsvg docs/casper/theory/diagrams/native-path-delta-encoding.puml
'          (or: ./render.sh native-path-delta-encoding.puml)

@startuml native-path-delta-encoding
!include palette.iuml
$ca_base_skin()
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #333333
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam ArrowColor $ca_neutral
title Delta encoding of consecutive causal paths (DR-74)

rectangle "**previous path**\n(0,1) (0,0) (2,2)" as Previous $ca_supply
rectangle "**current path**\n(0,1) (0,0) (3,1) (4,4)" as Current $ca_supply
rectangle "**maximal shared prefix**\n<latex>p = \mathrm{lcp}(\mathrm{current}, \mathrm{previous}) = 2</latex>" as Prefix $ca_process
rectangle "**canonical v2 entry**\np = 2 · s = 2 · (3,1) (4,4)" as Canonical $ca_pool
rectangle "**decoder**\nrebuild previous[0..p] ++ suffix\nreject when s > 0, p < len(previous),\nand suffix head = previous[p]" as Decoder $ca_gate
rectangle "**non-maximal entry**\np = 1 · s = 3 · (0,0) (3,1) (4,4)\nrejected: suffix head (0,0) = previous[1]" as NonMaximal $ca_rejectfill
rectangle "**decoded current path**\n(0,1) (0,0) (3,1) (4,4)" as Decoded $ca_note_green

Previous --> Prefix
Current --> Prefix
Prefix --> Canonical : encoder emits\nthe maximal prefix
Canonical --> Decoder
NonMaximal -[$ca_debit]-> Decoder
Decoder --> Decoded : accepted entry
note right of Decoder $ca_note_grey
  The previous path of the first attempt is
  empty. Retries continue the chain from the
  last attempt. v1 records still decode.
end note

legend bottom
  |= colour |= meaning |
  |<$ca_supply>| consecutive causal paths |
  |<$ca_process>| longest common prefix |
  |<$ca_pool>| the one canonical encoding |
  |<$ca_gate>| decoder bounds and canonicality check |
  |<$ca_rejectfill>| non-maximal encoding (rejected) |
  |<$ca_note_green>| decoded path |
endlegend

@enduml
